Progression Models in Resistance Training for Healthy Adults

Paper Metadata
This position stand reviews evidence-based progression models for resistance training in healthy adults. It summarizes recommendations for exercise selection, training frequency, volume, intensity, repetition ranges, rest intervals, progression strategies, periodization, and program design to maximize strength, hypertrophy, power, and muscular endurance across different training levels.



